EERRRROORRSS
       System call or memory allocation errors are fatal  and  are  handle  by
       calling  ppaanniicc(l).   The  one  exception  is a return of EINTR from ssee‐‐
       lleecctt(3c) or ppoollll(2) in ppoollll__ddiissppaattcchh.  In this case ppoollll__ddiissppaattcchh  sim‐
       ply returns.

